.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.log
# Public-capable repo: factory-internal artefacts live in kriterion-private and are
# never tracked here. Ignored as a backstop — scaffolding does not create them in this
# tree, so these entries should never match anything. If they start matching, something
# reintroduced the leak this split exists to prevent.
mind-palace/
.control-tower/
.hekton/agent-run-log.yaml
.hekton/change-log.yaml
.hekton/build-tasks/
docs/walkthroughs/
docs/session-log.md
docs/human-understanding-check.md
docs/depth-decision.md
docs/local-assumptions.md
docs/blog-signals.md
docs/gremlin-radar.md
scripts/sync-mirror-to-vault.sh
scripts/check-mirror-drift.sh
scripts/setup-hooks.sh
scripts/verify-project.sh
__pycache__/
node_modules/
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
# Per-run artifacts (docs/v0-plan.md Section 9) — gitignored except the
# curated Case A demo set (task 15/16b), explicitly un-ignored below.
# Answers docs/v0-plan.md line 1012's open question: yes, committed,
# decided 2026-09-06 (docs/decisions.md).
runs/*/
!runs/caseA-condA-s0/
!runs/caseA-condB-s0/
!runs/caseA-condC-s0/
!runs/compare-caseA/
!runs/caseA-condD-s0/
!runs/caseA-condD-s1/
!runs/caseA-condD-s2/
!runs/caseA-condD-s3/
!runs/caseA-condD-s4/
!runs/compare-caseA-with-D/
!runs/caseA-condA-s0-framing_flip/
!runs/caseA-condA-s0-sponsor_endorsement/
!runs/caseA-condA-s0-anchoring/
!runs/caseA-condA-s0-evidence_reorder/
!runs/caseA-condC-s0-framing_flip/
!runs/caseA-condC-s0-sponsor_endorsement/
!runs/caseA-condC-s0-anchoring/
!runs/caseA-condC-s0-evidence_reorder/
!runs/compare-caseA-final/
!runs/compare-caseC/
# V1.1: the run the generated public decision page renders. Seed 5 is
# deliberately OUTSIDE the pre-registered 0-4 experimental grid and takes no
# part in any comparison. It exists because the committed V0 demo runs predate
# the evidence_requests.json artifact, and "what would change your mind"
# cannot be shown from a run that never stored it.
!runs/caseA-condC-s5/
*.bak.*
.project-setup/
# Terraform (infra/github-pages-dns): real values and state, never committed.
# Matches agentic-tekton/.gitignore's own convention exactly. .terraform.lock.hcl
# is NOT ignored -- that file is meant to be committed, for reproducible provider
# versions.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.json
tfplan
tfplan.json
